  "details": "The VR keyboard is perfectly fine as it is in the base game; stop changing things that are not broken. I currently can not type with this keyboard while lying down, and overall it is extremely clunky and hard to type on properly, especially while using the chatbox!\n\nThe new keyboard is worse than the old keyboard layout; it's the old keyboard layout but requires extra steps for typing numbers, symbols, and letters. Also, why can we move the normal keyboard but not the text box to see what you're typing? This is crappy UI design that screws over people who lie down in VR, and it ruins people's muscle memory for those who use the old keyboard layout.\n\nThe old keyboard works completely fine; do not change it.\n\nIf you're extremely dead set and serious about making this the new modern keyboard, for the love of god, at least make it an optional toggle button in the user interface settings to switch between the legacy keyboard and the modern keyboard, as a halfway compromise.",
